==Battleground==
*10 [[Glowstick Guys]] spawn, delay 6.67~13.33 seconds<sup>200f~400f</sup>.
*10 [[Glowstick Guys]] spawn after 100 seconds<sup>3,000f</sup>, delay 10~20 seconds<sup>300f~600f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Glowstick Guys]] spawn after 200 seconds<sup>6,000f</sup>, delay 13.33~26.67 seconds<sup>400f~800f</sup>.
*5 [[Gabriel]]s spawn after 10 seconds<sup>300f</sup>, delay 6.67~10 seconds<sup>200f~300f</sup>.
*3 [[Heavenly Hippoe]]s spawn after 40 seconds<sup>1,200f</sup>, delay 3.33~10 seconds<sup>100f~300f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[Angelic Sleipnir]] spawns as the boss.
**1 [[Zir Zeal]] spawns.
**3 [[Gabriel]]s spawn, delay 0.07 seconds<sup>2f</sup>.
**2 [[Chickful A]]s spawn, delay 50 seconds<sup>1,500f</sup>.
**3 [[Gabriel]]s spawn, delay 0.07 seconds<sup>2f</sup>.
**Infinite [[Gabriel]]s spawn, delay 13.33~20 seconds<sup>400f~600f</sup>.
**Infinite [[Zoge]]s spawn, delay 26.67~40 seconds<sup>800f~1,200f</sup>.
**3 [[Angelic Gory|Angelic Gories]] spawn, delay 20~26.67 seconds<sup>600f~800f</sup>.
**1 [[Znache]] spawns.
**8 [[Znache]]s spawn, delay 13.33~20 seconds<sup>400f~600f</sup>.
**3 [[Zory|Zories]] spawn, delay 26.67~33.33 seconds<sup>800f~1,000f</sup>.

==Strategy==
The Zombie enemies aren't particularly hard to deal with: Bring two or less anti-Zombie cats so you can bring cats to deal with the Angel enemies without having too much trouble in [[In THE MOON|IN THE MOON]]. Given the good amount of Angel enemies here, [[Rocker Cat (Rare Cat)|Ramen Cat]] makes for a good meatshield to stall out a good number of the threats. [[Wushu Cat (Rare Cat)|Shigong Cat]] can be used against the periodic Zir Zeal and Zories when they burrow underneath your defences. [[Hip Hop Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Can Can Cat]] is useful both here and in [[In THE MOON|the next stage]], so they're a good pick too.

